<title>SWEDEN: Astra slashes some Danish Losec prices.</title>
<headline>Astra slashes some Danish Losec prices.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drugs company AB Astra said on Tuesday that it was slashing the price of its ulcer treatment drug Losec by 96 percent to Danish specialist doctors to match similar price cuts by competitors.</p>
</text>
